{{wikipedia|dab=overflow}}
==English==

===Etymology===
{{compound|over|flow}}.

Literally corresponds to {{term|superfluous|lang=en}}, which is from Latin, rather than Germanic.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[spillage]] resultant from overflow; [[excess]].

