===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To [[fill]] beyond the [[limit]]s of a [[container]] or [[system]].
# {{computing|ambitransitive}} To [[exceed]] the available [[numeric]] [[range]].
#: ''Calculating 255+1 will '''overflow''' an eight-bit byte.''

